==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Hyōgo Prefecture'''.
*South Africa's [[Treasure]] is a [[wikipedia:Vuvuzela|vuvuzela]], a plastic horn commonly heard at football matches in South Africa.
*The two women who form Hyōgo Prefecture's base look like they came from [[wikipedia:Takarazuka Revue|Takarazuka Revue]], a Hyōgo-based theatre troupe in which all roles, even the men, are played by unmarried women.

